#: ../../sessions/affectionate-great-noether/mnt/mapflow-docs-en/source/userguides/roads_model.rst:132
#: 364fb9d37a0344799bf16198aea00dff
msgid ""
"We evaluated the update using open benchmark datasets, including `SpaceNet 3"
" Roads <https://spacenet.ai/spacenet-roads-dataset/>`_, supplemented with "
"our own validation data across different urban environments."
msgstr ""
"Evaluamos la actualización con conjuntos de datos de referencia abiertos, "
"incluido `SpaceNet 3 Roads <https://spacenet.ai/spacenet-roads-dataset/>`_, "
"complementados con nuestros propios datos de validación en distintos "
"entornos urbanos."

#: ../../sessions/affectionate-great-noether/mnt/mapflow-docs-en/source/userguides/roads_model.rst:136
#: 5506e347250f442f929b4ee693d5e28b
msgid "We focused on two complementary metrics:"
msgstr "Nos centramos en dos métricas complementarias:"

#: ../../sessions/affectionate-great-noether/mnt/mapflow-docs-en/source/userguides/roads_model.rst:138
#: d39dd1b7341c486fa3091cf8f8ab455a
msgid ""
"**IoU (Intersection over Union)** measures how accurately the predicted road"
" mask matches the actual road coverage. It tells us how well the model "
"identifies roads and captures their spatial extent."
msgstr ""
"**IoU (Intersection over Union)** mide con qué precisión la máscara de "
"carreteras predicha coincide con la cobertura real de las carreteras. Indica"
" lo bien que el modelo identifica las carreteras y capta su extensión "
"espacial."

#: ../../sessions/affectionate-great-noether/mnt/mapflow-docs-en/source/userguides/roads_model.rst:141
#: 8897778bbf6e4c5d83dc77285b4b4fd8
msgid ""
"**Topology F1 (Topo-F1)** evaluates the connectivity of the extracted road "
"network. This is particularly important for mapping and routing, where roads"
" need to remain connected even when partially obscured by vegetation, "
"buildings or shadows."
msgstr ""
"**Topology F1 (Topo-F1)** evalúa la conectividad de la red de carreteras "
"extraída. Esto es especialmente importante para la cartografía y el "
"enrutamiento, donde las carreteras deben permanecer conectadas incluso "
"cuando están parcialmente ocultas por vegetación, edificios o sombras."

#: ../../sessions/affectionate-great-noether/mnt/mapflow-docs-en/source/userguides/roads_model.rst:145
#: afb83eab0d0d4fd18aa91988119da94f
msgid ""
"**The new model improves both metrics across all seven validation "
"datasets.** Compared with the original baseline, the average scores across "
